#: ../../../src/changes/2026/r028.md:8
msgid ""
"This release is the final update containing upstream changes for our "
"NixOS 25.11 platform. Going forward, security vulnerabilities for 25.11 "
"will only be patched on a case-by-case basis for severe issues. We "
"strongly recommend upgrading to the 26.05 platform as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

